Here is a list of places from **World of Warcraft: Vanilla (Classic)** lore, one for each letter of the alphabet.

*   **A** – Azeroth (The planet itself, but also commonly used to refer to the Eastern Kingdoms continent in early lore)
*   **B** – Blackrock Mountain (The massive volcanic mountain in the Burning Steppes)
*   **C** – Coldridge Valley (The starting zone for Dwarves and Gnomes in Dun Morogh)
*   **D** – Durotar (The starting zone for Orcs, Trolls, and Tauren on Kalimdor)
*   **E** – Elwynn Forest (The starting zone for Humans in the Eastern Kingdoms)
*   **F** – Felwood (The corrupted forest in Kalimdor, formerly known as Azshara’s northern reaches)
*   **G** – Gilneas (The isolated kingdom of the Worgen, accessible only via the Greymane Wall in Vanilla)
*   **H** – Hillsbrad Foothills (The zone connecting the Arathi Highlands to the Alterac Mountains)
*   **I** – Ironforge (The capital city of the Dwarves and Gnomes, located in Dun Morogh)
*   **J** – Jaina’s Island (A small island in the Eastern Plaguelands, named after Jaina Proudmoore)
*   **K** – Kalimdor (The western continent, home to the Horde and Night Elves)
*   **L** – Loch Modan (The zone connecting Dun Morogh to the Wetlands)
*   **M** – Mulgore (The starting zone for Tauren, located in the southern part of Kalimdor)
*   **N** – Netherstorm (Note: This is *not* in Vanilla. Let’s correct this.)
    *   *Correction for N:* **Nagrand** (The zone in Outland is TBC. In Vanilla, we need a Vanilla place.)
    *   *Better N:* **Northshire** (The starting zone for Humans in Elwynn Forest)
*   **O** – Orgrimmar (The capital city of the Horde, located in Durotar)
*   **P** – Plaguelands (The Eastern and Western Plaguelands, corrupted by the Scourge)
*   **Q** – Quel’Thalas (The elven homeland, though only the southern part was accessible in Vanilla, the name is iconic)
*   **R** – Redridge Mountains (The zone connecting Elwynn Forest to the Burning Steppes)
*   **S** – Stormwind City (The capital city of the Alliance, located in Elwynn Forest)
*   **T** – Tirisfal Glades (The starting zone for Undead in the Eastern Kingdoms)
*   **U** – Undercity (The capital city of the Undead, located in Tirisfal Glades)
*   **V** – Valley of Trials (The starting zone for Orcs and Trolls in Durotar)
*   **W** – Westfall (The zone connecting Elwynn Forest to the Redridge Mountains)
